{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52716","headline":"五子守仙丸歌 · 张果","name":"五子守仙丸歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返老成少是还丹，不得守仙亦大难。\n愁见鬓斑令却黑，一日但服三十丸。\n松竹本自无艳色，金液因从火制乾。\n五子可定千秋旨，百岁如同一万年。\n（《正统道藏》本《悬解录》。\n又《云笈七签》卷六四）（按：《悬解录》卷首有唐大中九年序。\n据《新唐书·艺文志》、《通志·艺文略》，并参陈国符先生所考，此序爲纥干臮作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张果","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}